OL,3,GNEWSACommunity hits minimum target to
OL,4,Asave village pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign group says it has reached
OL,7,Fits minimum target of #300,000 to help
OL,8,Fbring a pub into community ownership.
OL,10,FThe Stags Hunt pub in Ponsanooth closed
OL,11,Fin January 2025. Sam Fitch, chair of
OL,12,Fthe Save the Stag campaign, said saving
OL,13,Fthe pub was important because it was
OL,14,F"heart of the village".
OL,16,FHe said the money was raised through a
OL,17,Fcommunity share offer, which could only
OL,18,Frun for 12 months, and two days before
OL,19,Fthe deadline they had reached their
OL,20,Fminimum target.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
