OL,4,Asave village pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FFitch said the total they needed to buy
OL,7,Fthe pub was unclear as it was currently
OL,8,Fon the market for #490,000, but they
OL,9,Fhad had it valued at #390,000 and the
OL,10,Fbuilding required investment.
